  "title": "AXIL Brands, Inc. Reports Strong Fiscal Year 2025 Financial Results",
  "summary": "LOS ANGELES, August 21, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) – AXIL Brands, Inc. (“AXIL,” “we,” “us,” “our,” or the “Company”) (NYSE American: AXIL), an emerging global consumer products company for AXIL® hearing protection and enhancement products and Reviv3® hair and skin care products, today announced financial and operational results for fiscal year ended May 31, 2025.",
